---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-40 px-6 mt-24">
  <div class="text-center mb-20">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5F7D95] mb-4 font-secondary">Questions</p>
    <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black font-display tracking-tighter text-[#769966] mb-0">FAQ</h2>
    <p class="text-[#5F7D95] text-lg font-light mt-4">Answers to common questions.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-6">
    <details class="glass rounded-2xl group cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(197,231,241,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
      <summary class="text-lg font-bold font-display list-none flex justify-between items-center text-[#4A4A4A] group-open:text-[#82A7B9] transition-colors duration-300 select-none p-8">
        What is a game jam?
        <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 text-[#82A7B9] inline-block">↓</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-8 pb-8">
        <p class="text-[#5F7D95] leading-relaxed">
          A game jam is an event where you build a game from scratch in a short period of time. It's about creativity, learning, and having fun.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="glass rounded-2xl group cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(197,231,241,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
      <summary class="text-lg font-bold font-display list-none flex justify-between items-center text-[#4A4A4A] group-open:text-[#82A7B9] transition-colors duration-300 select-none p-8">
        Am I eligible to participate?
        <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 text-[#82A7B9] inline-block">↓</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-8 pb-8">
        <p class="text-[#5F7D95] leading-relaxed">
          If you're a teenager (13–18), you're in. No prior experience needed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="glass rounded-2xl group cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(197,231,241,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
      <summary class="text-lg font-bold font-display list-none flex justify-between items-center text-[#4A4A4A] group-open:text-[#82A7B9] transition-colors duration-300 select-none p-8">
        What if I don't have any experience?
        <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 text-[#82A7B9] inline-block">↓</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-8 pb-8">
        <p class="text-[#5F7D95] leading-relaxed">
          That's totally fine. There'll be workshops and mentors throughout the day to help you get unstuck.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="glass rounded-2xl group cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(197,231,241,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
      <summary class="text-lg font-bold font-display list-none flex justify-between items-center text-[#4A4A4A] group-open:text-[#82A7B9] transition-colors duration-300 select-none p-8">
        Is this free?
        <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 text-[#82A7B9] inline-block">↓</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-8 pb-8">
        <p class="text-[#5F7D95] leading-relaxed">
          Yes, everything is free — venue, food, workshops, prizes. Just show up.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="glass rounded-2xl group cursor-pointer hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(197,231,241,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
      <summary class="text-lg font-bold font-display list-none flex justify-between items-center text-[#4A4A4A] group-open:text-[#82A7B9] transition-colors duration-300 select-none p-8">
        What do I need to bring?
        <span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 text-[#82A7B9] inline-block">↓</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-8 pb-8">
        <p class="text-[#5F7D95] leading-relaxed">
          A laptop and a charger. We'll handle the rest.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
